message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Carbon Beyond the Bathtub"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kia
    given-names: Arya
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
url: "https://aryakia.github.io/carbon-cycle-demo/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aryakia/carbon-cycle-demo"
abstract: >-
  An interactive System Dynamics educational and research-prototype platform
  for atmospheric carbon accumulation, fossil-carbon lock-in, upstream
  investment dynamics, comparative policy experiments, a historically
  calibrated reduced-form atmospheric CO2 response, and a staged empirical
  fossil-dependency calibration/validation workflow including rolling-origin
  and multi-country spatial transfer testing.
keywords:
  - system dynamics
  - carbon cycle
  - carbon lock-in
  - climate policy
  - energy systems
  - model calibration
  - model validation
  - reproducible research
  - educational simulation
